                <head>334. Editorial Note</head>
                <p>On July 11, Holland forwarded a memorandum
                    to Dulles entitled, “Importance of
                    Present United States Relations with Argentina, Brazil and Chile.” The
                    memorandum is printed as <ref target="#d214">Document 214</ref>.</p>
            </div>
